# Goblin-town: "This land enters tapped", "{T}: Add {B} or {R}" and "{2}{B}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice this land: Put two +1/+1
# counters on target Goblin or Orc you control. Activate only as a sorcery." A Goblin. The land is tapped the turn it enters and untaps next
# turn; it taps for either color and no other (Undo takes each tap back); the ability is refused outside a main phase and at an
# Ornithopter or the opponent's Goblin Champion, and puts exactly two counters on Bot1's Goblin Champion (the {T} and the sacrifice are costs,
# paid exactly with four Moxen) (CR 602.5d, 122.1).

